{"ep": "15", "idx": 0, "start": "0:00:01.64", "end": "0:00:05.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有什么东西怪怪的  我不知为啥有这种感觉"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 1, "start": "0:00:07.86", "end": "0:00:11.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不知为啥我正看着一点关系都没有的同县选手的比赛"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 2, "start": "0:00:12.47", "end": "0:00:16.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "然后又不知为啥觉得差不多春日要搞点事出来了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 3, "start": "0:00:25.06", "end": "0:00:26.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚  电话"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 4, "start": "0:00:27.78", "end": "0:00:29.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不用你说我也知道"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 5, "start": "0:00:31.75", "end": "0:00:33.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚  你今天很闲吧"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 6, "start": "0:00:35.20", "end": "0:00:38.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "两点整全员在车站前集合  老老实实地过来哦"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 7, "start": "0:00:42.12", "end": "0:00:44.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我连一句话都没说上"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 8, "start": "0:00:48.92", "end": "0:00:49.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 9, "start": "0:00:49.92", "end": "0:00:51.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "忘跟你说带东西来了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 10, "start": "0:00:51.90", "end": "0:00:54.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一套泳装  还有足够的钱"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 11, "start": "0:00:54.53", "end": "0:00:55.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还有  一定要…"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 12, "start": "0:00:55.51", "end": "0:00:57.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "…骑自行车过去是吧"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 13, "start": "0:00:58.17", "end": "0:01:00.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯？是啊  你知道啊"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 14, "start": "0:01:00.95", "end": "0:01:02.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "迟到的话  要请客的啊"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 15, "start": "0:01:05.61", "end": "0:01:07.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我刚才为什么会说出自行车的…"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 16, "start": "0:01:13.50", "end": "0:01:15.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这一球能上垒吧"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 17, "start": "0:01:17.77", "end": "0:01:18.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "看吧"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 18, "start": "0:01:19.00", "end": "0:01:21.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "泳衣…放哪儿去了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 19, "start": "0:01:22.25", "end": "0:01:23.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "夏天就这样缴枪了啊"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 20, "start": "0:02:56.90", "end": "0:02:58.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "太慢了  阿虚！"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 21, "start": "0:02:58.38", "end": "0:02:59.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是是"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 22, "start": "0:02:59.99", "end": "0:03:01.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "让你们久等真抱歉"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 23, "start": "0:03:02.02", "end": "0:03:03.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我也才刚到"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 24, "start": "0:03:04.03", "end": "0:03:06.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真是的  多拿出点干劲嘛"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 25, "start": "0:03:07.66", "end": "0:03:10.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  全都到齐了  出发吧"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 26, "start": "0:03:10.48", "end": "0:03:11.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "去哪里？"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 27, "start": "0:03:12.01", "end": "0:03:13.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "当然是去市民游泳池啊"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 28, "start": "0:03:14.44", "end": "0:03:15.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "原来如此"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 29, "start": "0:03:15.13", "end": "0:03:18.08", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "夏天要有夏天的样子  不能不做有夏天特色的事情"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 30, "start": "0:03:15.88", "end": "0:03:17.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "从这准备的架势来看也是吧"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 31, "start": "0:03:18.84", "end": "0:03:22.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "失去的时间可是一去不返的啊"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 32, "start": "0:03:22.39", "end": "0:03:23.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以现在就要行动"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 33, "start": "0:03:23.63", "end": "0:03:26.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在这个只有一次的高一的暑假里"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 34, "start": "0:03:27.33", "end": "0:03:28.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我说阿虚  你有在听吗"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 35, "start": "0:03:29.27", "end": "0:03:30.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哦  哦…"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 36, "start": "0:03:30.82", "end": "0:03:33.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "顺便我们是用自行车去泳池"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 37, "start": "0:03:33.64", "end": "0:03:36.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哦  你们的自行车停哪里了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 38, "start": "0:03:36.43", "end": "0:03:39.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  自行车只有你和我的两辆"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 39, "start": "0:03:40.16", "end": "0:03:42.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "诶？那个  也就是…"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 40, "start": "0:03:42.20", "end": "0:03:43.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这么回事啊"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 41, "start": "0:03:43.65", "end": "0:03:45.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "听好了 阿虚 可不能输给古泉哦"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 42, "start": "0:03:46.41", "end": "0:03:48.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  出发…立即！"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 43, "start": "0:03:48.28", "end": "0:03:49.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "魔鬼！罗刹！"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 44, "start": "0:03:52.02", "end": "0:03:55.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "喂  阿虚  接下来是要玩啊你怎么就筋疲力尽了？"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 45, "start": "0:03:55.74", "end": "0:03:57.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是谁的错啊  谁的啊！"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 46, "start": "0:03:59.02", "end": "0:04:02.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯  这人群  这消毒液的气味"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 47, "start": "0:04:02.61", "end": "0:04:04.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真给人一种实在的感觉啊"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 48, "start": "0:04:04.45", "end": "0:04:08.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好了  赶快把行李放在一边占上地方去游泳吧"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 49, "start": "0:04:10.54", "end": "0:04:11.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "喂"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 50, "start": "0:04:12.78", "end": "0:04:15.19", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那家伙就看不见那些禁止跳水的文字说明么"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 51, "start": "0:04:17.56", "end": "0:04:19.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "水温温的很舒服哦"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 52, "start": "0:04:20.37", "end": "0:04:21.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠  有希"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 53, "start": "0:04:21.97", "end": "0:04:24.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你们还站着干什么  快点过来啊"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 54, "start": "0:04:22.81", "end": "0:04:23.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "请先去玩吧"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 55, "start": "0:04:24.36", "end": "0:04:26.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那家伙  不理她的话又该吵个不停了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 56, "start": "0:04:26.64", "end": "0:04:32.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  那么  凉宫同学  请等一下"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 57, "start": "0:04:32.75", "end": "0:04:33.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真慢啊"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 58, "start": "0:04:34.29", "end": "0:04:35.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊…等…不要啦"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 59, "start": "0:04:37.63", "end": "0:04:40.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哈哈  还真让人感到和平呢"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 60, "start": "0:04:42.03", "end": "0:04:43.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  我说的是凉宫同学"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 61, "start": "0:04:44.57", "end": "0:04:48.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你不觉得她也学会了有常识性的娱乐方法了么"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 62, "start": "0:04:49.39", "end": "0:04:54.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "突然打个电话过来  单方面地说有事就挂的邀请方式"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 63, "start": "0:04:54.61", "end": "0:04:55.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实在不能说得上是常识性的吧"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 64, "start": "0:04:56.52", "end": "0:05:00.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就那点事  要我说根本不算什么"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 65, "start": "0:05:01.31", "end": "0:05:03.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "笑得那么开心的凉宫同学"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 66, "start": "0:05:04.06", "end": "0:05:06.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是不会做什么震动这个世界的事情的吧"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 67, "start": "0:05:07.58", "end": "0:05:08.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果真是那样就好了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 68, "start": "0:05:10.21", "end": "0:05:10.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯？"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 69, "start": "0:05:11.55", "end": "0:05:12.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么了？"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 70, "start": "0:05:12.60", "end": "0:05:18.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  不  大概是我的错觉吧"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 71, "start": "0:05:18.75", "end": "0:05:20.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "初春以来发生了种种事情的缘故"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 72, "start": "0:05:21.06", "end": "0:05:22.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "变得有点神经质了吧"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 73, "start": "0:05:23.88", "end": "0:05:24.50", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好奇怪"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 74, "start": "0:05:24.76", "end": "0:05:25.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这家伙也是么"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 75, "start": "0:05:43.77", "end": "0:05:44.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真是的"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 76, "start": "0:05:45.73", "end": "0:05:48.50", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "与其说是市民泳池  倒应该是平民泳池啊"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 77, "start": "0:05:50.89", "end": "0:05:53.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那家伙  原来在那边啊"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 78, "start": "0:05:53.84", "end": "0:05:56.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么  她一个人在干什么…"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 79, "start": "0:05:57.43", "end": "0:06:01.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "什么？是啥  这种感觉"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 80, "start": "0:06:02.16", "end": "0:06:03.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "觉得这种景象以前也…"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 81, "start": "0:06:04.52", "end": "0:06:06.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "之前好像也见过这样的长门…"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 82, "start": "0:06:07.13", "end": "0:06:07.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 83, "start": "0:06:09.81", "end": "0:06:10.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "春日？"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 84, "start": "0:06:11.83", "end": "0:06:14.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这么说起来  之后她似乎便会说出这样的话"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 85, "start": "0:06:15.95", "end": "0:06:18.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这两个就是我的团员"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 86, "start": "0:06:18.19", "end": "0:06:20.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "说什么他们都会听的  所以随便…"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 87, "start": "0:06:20.36", "end": "0:06:21.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "…吩咐他们吧"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 88, "start": "0:06:22.22", "end": "0:06:23.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "来玩水中足球吧"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 89, "start": "0:06:24.02", "end": "0:06:25.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "大家都要参加哦"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 90, "start": "0:06:25.72", "end": "0:06:26.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有希"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 91, "start": "0:06:27.04", "end": "0:06:29.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我难道具有预知能力吗"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 92, "start": "0:06:29.72", "end": "0:06:30.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "给你  阿虚  皮球"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 93, "start": "0:06:31.93", "end": "0:06:32.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "…好像也不是"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 94, "start": "0:06:36.76", "end": "0:06:38.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "算了  偶然的吧"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 95, "start": "0:06:38.71", "end": "0:06:40.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "常有的事了  既视感什么的"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 96, "start": "0:06:42.55", "end": "0:06:44.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我考虑了下今后的活动计划"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 97, "start": "0:06:45.79", "end": "0:06:46.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那是啥"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 98, "start": "0:06:47.19", "end": "0:06:50.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "剩余不多的暑假该如何度过的预定表啦"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 99, "start": "0:06:51.06", "end": "0:06:53.27", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "要在不到两周内搞完这个"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 100, "start": "0:06:51.52", "end": "0:06:53.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "要在不到两周内搞完这个么…"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 101, "start": "0:06:53.77", "end": "0:06:55.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠  有什么想要做的事情么"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 102, "start": "0:06:56.29", "end": "0:06:59.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个…我想捞金鱼…"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 103, "start": "0:06:59.45", "end": "0:07:02.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "OK  捞金鱼"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 104, "start": "0:07:03.19", "end": "0:07:05.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不好意思  我看下"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 105, "start": "0:07:10.27", "end": "0:07:10.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "谢谢"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 106, "start": "0:07:12.03", "end": "0:07:13.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么明天开始实行"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 107, "start": "0:07:14.34", "end": "0:07:16.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这附近什么地方有盂兰盆会么"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 108, "start": "0:07:16.77", "end": "0:07:18.26", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有烟花汇演也可以"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 109, "start": "0:07:18.68", "end": "0:07:19.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我去查吧"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 110, "start": "0:07:20.46", "end": "0:07:21.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "回头再联系你"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 111, "start": "0:07:21.95", "end": "0:07:23.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "别忘了捞金鱼哦"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 112, "start": "0:07:23.87", "end": "0:07:25.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这可是实玖瑠的强烈要求哦"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 113, "start": "0:07:28.04", "end": "0:07:29.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "付钱的又是我啊"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 114, "start": "0:07:29.82", "end": "0:07:31.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "来晚的要请客我不是说了吗"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 115, "start": "0:07:32.48", "end": "0:07:35.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  今天就此解散  再见"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 116, "start": "0:07:37.44", "end": "0:07:38.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么我也回去了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 117, "start": "0:07:38.56", "end": "0:07:39.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  再见"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 118, "start": "0:07:39.61", "end": "0:07:40.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 119, "start": "0:07:50.70", "end": "0:07:51.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "长门"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 120, "start": "0:07:54.56", "end": "0:07:58.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  不…我什么事也没有啦"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 121, "start": "0:08:01.88", "end": "0:08:04.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "最近如何  精神好么"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 122, "start": "0:08:05.38", "end": "0:08:06.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 123, "start": "0:08:07.50", "end": "0:08:10.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是么  那太好了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 124, "start": "0:08:10.95", "end": "0:08:11.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是么"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 125, "start": "0:08:16.93", "end": "0:08:19.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯  仅此而已了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 126, "start": "0:08:20.04", "end": "0:08:21.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不好意思  叫住了你"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 127, "start": "0:08:26.94", "end": "0:08:32.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么了  为什么我会去搭腔"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 128, "start": "0:08:36.20", "end": "0:08:39.19", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "第二天早晨  春日的电话又来了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 129, "start": "0:08:40.03", "end": "0:08:41.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "说找到盂兰盆会的会场了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 130, "start": "0:08:42.33", "end": "0:08:44.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好像是今晚在市民运动场"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 131, "start": "0:08:44.97", "end": "0:08:45.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "久等了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 132, "start": "0:08:46.57", "end": "0:08:48.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好慢…唔哦哦哦哦～"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 133, "start": "0:08:48.93", "end": "0:08:50.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "各位  都非常合适哦"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 134, "start": "0:08:51.17", "end": "0:08:53.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "当然啦  是我给挑选的嘛"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 135, "start": "0:08:54.24", "end": "0:08:55.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "特别是实玖瑠"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 136, "start": "0:08:55.57", "end": "0:08:57.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真不愧是我挑的"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 137, "start": "0:08:57.29", "end": "0:08:59.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "朝比奈学姐…赞  真赞！"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 138, "start": "0:09:06.54", "end": "0:09:10.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个…关键的东西在哪里呢"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 139, "start": "0:09:11.24", "end": "0:09:13.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么回事  总觉得最近好像来过"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 140, "start": "0:09:14.27", "end": "0:09:16.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个楼塔  那个店铺"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 141, "start": "0:09:16.72", "end": "0:09:17.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好像有看过的…"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 142, "start": "0:09:18.07", "end": "0:09:19.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  实玖瑠"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 143, "start": "0:09:20.09", "end": "0:09:22.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "快看  那边你想要玩的捞金鱼也有哦"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 144, "start": "0:09:23.13", "end": "0:09:24.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "捞个痛快吧"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 145, "start": "0:09:24.95", "end": "0:09:27.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "凉…凉宫同学  请等一下～"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 146, "start": "0:09:28.74", "end": "0:09:29.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们也去玩吗"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 147, "start": "0:09:30.28", "end": "0:09:31.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  算了吧"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 148, "start": "0:09:32.47", "end": "0:09:33.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "比起这个来  长门"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 149, "start": "0:09:34.70", "end": "0:09:36.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你要吃点什么吗"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 150, "start": "0:09:42.48", "end": "0:09:43.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你对那种东西有兴趣么"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 151, "start": "0:09:45.72", "end": "0:09:46.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哪个？"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 152, "start": "0:09:46.57", "end": "0:09:47.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不用了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 153, "start": "0:09:48.45", "end": "0:09:49.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 154, "start": "0:09:49.33", "end": "0:09:50.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好的  800日元"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 155, "start": "0:09:51.54", "end": "0:09:53.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不知为啥有种受她照顾的感觉"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 156, "start": "0:09:54.26", "end": "0:09:56.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那种东西由我来买就好了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 157, "start": "0:09:58.06", "end": "0:09:58.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "十三条"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 158, "start": "0:09:59.72", "end": "0:10:01.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不过我们不需要那么多"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 159, "start": "0:10:01.90", "end": "0:10:04.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "于是我和实玖瑠就一人拿了一条"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 160, "start": "0:10:05.79", "end": "0:10:08.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "给  只吃一个的话没关系哦"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 161, "start": "0:10:08.78", "end": "0:10:09.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "谢谢了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 162, "start": "0:10:10.35", "end": "0:10:12.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "咦  有希  你那面具哪里弄来的"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 163, "start": "0:10:14.37", "end": "0:10:14.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "买的"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 164, "start": "0:10:15.64", "end": "0:10:17.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哦  是么"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 165, "start": "0:10:18.93", "end": "0:10:20.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  接下来玩烟花吧"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 166, "start": "0:10:20.74", "end": "0:10:22.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "今天就一起做了吧"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 167, "start": "0:10:24.83", "end": "0:10:27.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在是夏天  在暑假中"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 168, "start": "0:10:28.14", "end": "0:10:30.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以  虽然极力想要忘记"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 169, "start": "0:10:30.65", "end": "0:10:32.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但有件事情却让我很在意"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 170, "start": "0:10:34.07", "end": "0:10:35.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "明天是捉昆虫哦"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 171, "start": "0:10:36.43", "end": "0:10:40.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "春日啊  虽说玩也没问题  你暑假作业做完了么"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 172, "start": "0:10:42.94", "end": "0:10:46.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "作业？那种东西三天不就全部做完了吗"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 173, "start": "0:10:46.94", "end": "0:10:47.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啥…"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 174, "start": "0:10:48.36", "end": "0:10:52.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那种麻烦事就得事先赶紧收拾掉再玩到爽"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 175, "start": "0:10:52.67", "end": "0:10:55.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这才是正确的享受暑假的方法哦"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 176, "start": "0:10:56.31", "end": "0:10:57.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "老天真是太不公平了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 177, "start": "0:10:58.25", "end": "0:11:00.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "各位  明天去捉昆虫哦"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 178, "start": "0:11:01.03", "end": "0:11:02.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而且只能捉蝉"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 179, "start": "0:11:02.63", "end": "0:11:04.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "SOS团内捉蝉大战"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 180, "start": "0:11:06.02", "end": "0:11:09.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "第二天  是个让人有种「连这也是啊」的感觉的大晴天"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 181, "start": "0:11:10.29", "end": "0:11:14.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "SOS团内捉蝉大战就在这天开始了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 182, "start": "0:11:14.80", "end": "0:11:19.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽说大家都努力奋斗过了  可应该说不出所料还是说啥呢"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 183, "start": "0:11:19.62", "end": "0:11:21.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "获胜者是春日"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 184, "start": "0:11:23.80", "end": "0:11:26.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "果然捕捉再放生的精神还是要有的"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 185, "start": "0:11:27.41", "end": "0:11:30.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "今天放它们一条生路  以后说不定会来报恩呢"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 186, "start": "0:11:31.40", "end": "0:11:34.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你想向余命无多的蝉要些什么啊"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 187, "start": "0:11:38.69", "end": "0:11:41.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "总觉得有点像打开了盒子的潘多拉的感觉呢"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 188, "start": "0:11:47.12", "end": "0:11:52.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "第二天  不知为啥我们在一无所知的情况下  被套上了青蛙的罩衣"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 189, "start": "0:11:52.92", "end": "0:11:56.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在超市的门口做发气球的兼职"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 190, "start": "0:11:59.26", "end": "0:12:01.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "可算是理解除去装甲的Virtue的心情了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 191, "start": "0:12:02.56", "end": "0:12:03.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "各位辛苦了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 192, "start": "0:12:04.77", "end": "0:12:06.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这待遇差算啥啊"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 193, "start": "0:12:06.73", "end": "0:12:07.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "辛苦了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 194, "start": "0:12:07.89", "end": "0:12:09.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "店长大叔也谢谢大家了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 195, "start": "0:12:10.25", "end": "0:12:11.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我才不要大叔的感谢"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 196, "start": "0:12:12.05", "end": "0:12:12.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "工钱呢"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 197, "start": "0:12:13.58", "end": "0:12:14.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个咯"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 198, "start": "0:12:14.68", "end": "0:12:15.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊？"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 199, "start": "0:12:15.64", "end": "0:12:17.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我很早之前就很想要这个了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 200, "start": "0:12:18.03", "end": "0:12:21.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "大叔也看在实玖瑠的份上说送给我们的"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 201, "start": "0:12:22.74", "end": "0:12:26.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们就为了这种东西累死累活地干活么"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 202, "start": "0:12:27.00", "end": "0:12:29.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就把它放在社团室做纪念吧"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 203, "start": "0:12:29.72", "end": "0:12:33.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠  你想什么时候穿都可以哦"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 204, "start": "0:12:33.49", "end": "0:12:34.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我许可了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 205, "start": "0:12:35.23", "end": "0:12:39.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  那个…十分感谢"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 206, "start": "0:12:41.95", "end": "0:12:44.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那天晚上  夺去了我的安眠的"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 207, "start": "0:12:44.83", "end": "0:12:46.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "又是一个电话"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 208, "start": "0:12:47.83", "end": "0:12:49.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  好吵…"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 209, "start": "0:12:58.14", "end": "0:12:58.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好吵"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 210, "start": "0:12:59.24", "end": "0:12:59.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "可恶"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 211, "start": "0:13:01.41", "end": "0:13:02.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊…是"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 212, "start": "0:13:04.72", "end": "0:13:06.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚…"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 213, "start": "0:13:07.35", "end": "0:13:08.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "朝比奈学姐？"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 214, "start": "0:13:08.87", "end": "0:13:11.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是  是我…"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 215, "start": "0:13:12.59", "end": "0:13:18.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "发生了不好的事情…这样下去我…"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 216, "start": "0:13:19.50", "end": "0:13:20.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那  那个…"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 217, "start": "0:13:20.86", "end": "0:13:21.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你好  我是古泉"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 218, "start": "0:13:24.14", "end": "0:13:26.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你怎么会跟朝比奈学姐在一起？"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 219, "start": "0:13:27.46", "end": "0:13:31.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为有点情况啊  你能现在能过来吗"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 220, "start": "0:13:31.81", "end": "0:13:33.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我马上就去  马上就去！"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 221, "start": "0:13:34.41", "end": "0:13:35.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "朝比奈学姐！"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 222, "start": "0:13:36.64", "end": "0:13:37.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "究竟怎么了？"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 223, "start": "0:13:41.03", "end": "0:13:43.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚  我…"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 224, "start": "0:13:44.30", "end": "0:13:49.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我回不了未来了…"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 225, "start": "0:13:45.37", "end": "0:13:46.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "未  未…未来？"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 226, "start": "0:13:52.84", "end": "0:13:54.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也就是说  事情是这样的"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 227, "start": "0:13:55.27", "end": "0:13:58.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们在永久地重复着同样的时间"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 228, "start": "0:14:03.25", "end": "0:14:06.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就算你满面春光地把那种非现实的话说出来…"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 229, "start": "0:14:06.98", "end": "0:14:09.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你知道自己在说什么吗"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 230, "start": "0:14:10.16", "end": "0:14:13.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "知道  没有比现在更清楚的了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 231, "start": "0:14:13.98", "end": "0:14:16.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我刚才和朝比奈学姐谈了下"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 232, "start": "0:14:16.81", "end": "0:14:19.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "倒是叫上我啊  这么美的谈话"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 233, "start": "0:14:19.72", "end": "0:14:24.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "然后意识到最近这里时间的流动出现了异常"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 234, "start": "0:14:25.95", "end": "0:14:28.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这该说是朝比奈学姐的功绩吧"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 235, "start": "0:14:29.25", "end": "0:14:31.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "托她的福我也确信了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 236, "start": "0:14:32.66", "end": "0:14:33.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "确信什么了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 237, "start": "0:14:34.43", "end": "0:14:38.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们似乎已经重复体验同样的时间许多次了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 238, "start": "0:14:38.71", "end": "0:14:39.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个刚才就听你说了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 239, "start": "0:14:40.70", "end": "0:14:45.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "正确地说应该是八月十七日到三十一日之间"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 240, "start": "0:14:45.83", "end": "0:14:49.26", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们正处于一个没有尽头的暑假的正当中"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 241, "start": "0:14:49.97", "end": "0:14:52.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在确实是暑假"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 242, "start": "0:14:52.94", "end": "0:14:55.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是绝对无法结束的Endless Summer"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 243, "start": "0:14:55.97", "end": "0:15:00.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在这个世界里  九月一日之后的时间全部消失了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 244, "start": "0:15:01.04", "end": "0:15:03.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "朝比奈学姐无法回到未来也是因为这个"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 245, "start": "0:15:04.72", "end": "0:15:05.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这是理所当然的了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 246, "start": "0:15:07.99", "end": "0:15:10.50", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "物理性的没有未来哪里理所当然了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 247, "start": "0:15:11.13", "end": "0:15:12.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你要谁相信那个啊"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 248, "start": "0:15:15.43", "end": "0:15:18.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我希望至少你能相信"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 249, "start": "0:15:19.51", "end": "0:15:23.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么我们被困在那个叫什么封闭空间里了吗"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 250, "start": "0:15:24.24", "end": "0:15:25.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  并不是这样"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 251, "start": "0:15:26.29", "end": "0:15:28.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只是一部分的时间被分割开了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 252, "start": "0:15:29.76", "end": "0:15:33.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "到八月三十一日二十四时整的那一瞬"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 253, "start": "0:15:33.70", "end": "0:15:37.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一切都被重置  再回到十七日的过程"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 254, "start": "0:15:38.55", "end": "0:15:40.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "又是关于时间这个那个了的问题吗"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 255, "start": "0:15:41.64", "end": "0:15:45.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "既然未来人也混进来了  那我觉得也没办法"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 256, "start": "0:15:45.64", "end": "0:15:49.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  这件事和朝比奈学姐没关系"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 257, "start": "0:15:49.76", "end": "0:15:51.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那原因是什么"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 258, "start": "0:15:51.42", "end": "0:15:52.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是凉宫同学吧"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 259, "start": "0:15:55.19", "end": "0:15:56.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然本人没有这个自觉"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 260, "start": "0:15:57.39", "end": "0:16:01.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是心里什么地方总在想着暑假不要结束吧"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 261, "start": "0:16:02.23", "end": "0:16:04.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那算啥啊  难道留着什么遗憾吗"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 262, "start": "0:16:05.35", "end": "0:16:06.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我也是这么想的"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 263, "start": "0:16:07.11", "end": "0:16:12.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也许她是想着暑假还有什么事情剩下没做吧"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 264, "start": "0:16:15.73", "end": "0:16:17.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  我该怎么办"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 265, "start": "0:16:17.98", "end": "0:16:20.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "明白了这个的话  问题就能迎刃而解了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 266, "start": "0:16:21.73", "end": "0:16:22.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你好像乐在其中呢"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 267, "start": "0:16:24.15", "end": "0:16:28.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为最近频繁发生的既视感之谜终于解开了嘛"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 268, "start": "0:16:30.12", "end": "0:16:34.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我说  莫非全世界的人都感觉得到这个吗"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 269, "start": "0:16:34.55", "end": "0:16:35.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "并非那样"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 270, "start": "0:16:36.83", "end": "0:16:39.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我和你算是特例了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 271, "start": "0:16:40.10", "end": "0:16:45.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好像只有和凉宫同学亲近的人才能感觉到这份异样"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 272, "start": "0:16:45.90", "end": "0:16:47.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那春日怎么样"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 273, "start": "0:16:47.64", "end": "0:16:49.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那家伙多少有一点意识到吗"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 274, "start": "0:16:49.47", "end": "0:16:51.26", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一点都没有呢"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 275, "start": "0:16:52.04", "end": "0:16:54.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "倒不如说有了反而糟糕了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 276, "start": "0:16:56.06", "end": "0:16:58.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是  别说是既视感了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 277, "start": "0:16:58.71", "end": "0:17:05.26", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我觉得应该有一个人保存着所有轮回中的记忆"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 278, "start": "0:17:06.69", "end": "0:17:08.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这话可真让人没兴趣"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 279, "start": "0:17:09.44", "end": "0:17:10.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "谁啊  那个人"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 280, "start": "0:17:11.46", "end": "0:17:13.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不用说也该知道吧"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 281, "start": "0:17:15.01", "end": "0:17:17.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "既然是超越了时空的情报统合思念体的话"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 282, "start": "0:17:18.12", "end": "0:17:18.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我觉得也许是的"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 283, "start": "0:17:21.68", "end": "0:17:23.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "长门  是这样的吗"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 284, "start": "0:17:24.18", "end": "0:17:24.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 285, "start": "0:17:25.58", "end": "0:17:26.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你全都记得吗"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 286, "start": "0:17:27.46", "end": "0:17:28.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 287, "start": "0:17:29.04", "end": "0:17:32.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "顺带问下  这重复…现在到底几次了？"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 288, "start": "0:17:35.37", "end": "0:17:39.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这次是第15513次"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 289, "start": "0:17:43.48", "end": "0:17:46.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "15513？"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 290, "start": "0:17:47.14", "end": "0:17:50.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "15513是啥啊"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 291, "start": "0:17:50.84", "end": "0:17:53.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "长门  你在说啥啊"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 292, "start": "0:17:55.57", "end": "0:17:57.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你那话是认真的吗"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 293, "start": "0:17:57.97", "end": "0:17:58.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 294, "start": "0:17:59.43", "end": "0:18:03.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么多的次数  我们全都在重复同样的事情吗"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 295, "start": "0:18:04.82", "end": "0:18:06.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "并非全部如此"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 296, "start": "0:18:06.93", "end": "0:18:07.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "诶？"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 297, "start": "0:18:07.81", "end": "0:18:08.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也就是说？"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 298, "start": "0:18:09.29", "end": "0:18:18.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "15513次中没有去盂兰盆会的模式  有第2391次和第11054次的这两次"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 299, "start": "0:18:19.54", "end": "0:18:24.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "另外  去了盂兰盆会而没有捞金鱼的模式有437次"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 300, "start": "0:18:25.77", "end": "0:18:31.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "去打工的有9031次  其内容有6个不同的…"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 301, "start": "0:18:31.77", "end": "0:18:36.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "除了发放气球  还有搬货物  收银  发送传单  接电话…"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 302, "start": "0:18:35.94", "end": "0:18:37.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "…不  已经够了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 303, "start": "0:18:47.42", "end": "0:18:50.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "第15513次…"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 304, "start": "0:18:50.69", "end": "0:18:51.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "长门她这么说了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 305, "start": "0:18:52.93", "end": "0:18:55.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "乘上两周的话就是…唔…"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 306, "start": "0:18:55.86", "end": "0:18:58.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "差不多是594年的时间了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 307, "start": "0:18:59.31", "end": "0:19:00.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么长的时间仅她一个人"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 308, "start": "0:19:00.84", "end": "0:19:05.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "能够好好地保留着记忆  无数次无数次地重复吗"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 309, "start": "0:19:09.52", "end": "0:19:14.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "长门  你到底到现在为止都是什么样的心情"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 310, "start": "0:19:20.82", "end": "0:19:21.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是不是没有啊"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 311, "start": "0:19:21.89", "end": "0:19:22.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊？"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 312, "start": "0:19:22.61", "end": "0:19:23.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "火星人"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 313, "start": "0:19:23.89", "end": "0:19:25.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我倒不希望它存在啊"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 314, "start": "0:19:26.37", "end": "0:19:30.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "应该是在地下的生活着的害羞人种"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 315, "start": "0:19:30.61", "end": "0:19:32.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一定是一群很友好的人"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 316, "start": "0:19:32.74", "end": "0:19:34.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那可不一定哦"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 317, "start": "0:19:34.68", "end": "0:19:36.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真是的  我看够了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 318, "start": "0:19:37.06", "end": "0:19:38.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "来找UFO吧  UFO"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 319, "start": "0:19:41.65", "end": "0:19:44.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这家伙到底想做啥啊"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 320, "start": "0:19:45.30", "end": "0:19:47.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是啊  是什么呢"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 321, "start": "0:19:47.89", "end": "0:19:50.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个能搞清楚的话  问题也就迎刃而解了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 322, "start": "0:19:51.61", "end": "0:19:53.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  试下这样怎么样"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 323, "start": "0:19:54.36", "end": "0:19:54.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯？"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 324, "start": "0:19:55.05", "end": "0:19:57.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "从后面突然抱住凉宫同学"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 325, "start": "0:19:57.87", "end": "0:20:00.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在她耳边轻语「I love you」"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 326, "start": "0:20:01.38", "end": "0:20:03.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这由谁来做啊"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 327, "start": "0:20:03.45", "end": "0:20:05.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "除了你以外  有没有适合的人呢"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 328, "start": "0:20:06.27", "end": "0:20:07.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "拒绝权发动"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 329, "start": "0:20:08.31", "end": "0:20:09.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就是说不干"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 330, "start": "0:20:09.58", "end": "0:20:10.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没办法呢"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 331, "start": "0:20:11.36", "end": "0:20:13.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  我来做怎么样"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 332, "start": "0:20:14.90", "end": "0:20:19.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "开玩笑的了  我做这角色还不够格"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 333, "start": "0:20:20.00", "end": "0:20:22.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这样只会让凉宫同学增加多余的混乱吧"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 334, "start": "0:20:28.04", "end": "0:20:29.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我说  长门"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 335, "start": "0:20:30.03", "end": "0:20:34.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你在朝比奈学姐说出来之前  就注意到了这轮回吧"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 336, "start": "0:20:34.86", "end": "0:20:35.26", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 337, "start": "0:20:35.70", "end": "0:20:37.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那为什么沉默不语"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 338, "start": "0:20:39.20", "end": "0:20:41.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为我的任务是观察"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 339, "start": "0:20:42.55", "end": "0:20:43.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "原来如此"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 340, "start": "0:20:44.87", "end": "0:20:48.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "成功了！快看  本垒打哦！"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 341, "start": "0:20:49.95", "end": "0:20:52.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们一直在活动来活动去的"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 342, "start": "0:20:50.91", "end": "0:20:52.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "太好了  太好了"}
{"ep": "15", "idx": 343, "start": "0:20:53.52", "end": "0:20:55.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也去了真正的烟花汇演"}
